{"version":1,"content":"<p>男神張智霖（Chilam）前晚(24日）在佛山舉行巡唱，故缺席昨日（25日）的《璀璨之城》宣傳。</p><p>原籍佛山南海的他首次回鄉開騷，感覺格外親切，騷後他在社交網答謝鄉親支持：「佛山老家場圓滿，謝謝你們！</p><p>」他還邀來老拍檔許秋怡擔任神秘嘉賓，合唱《片</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:34.221467+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:21:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.350995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.350995+00:00","content_hash":"b7031c6d08112ea4f293a65b148855fca4ef18c9793fd9c5bb5b3aa6d8da8c1f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}